[background arg="res://assets/backgrounds/town_center_placeholder.jpg" fade="0.0"]
Narrator: Catherine has stopped pretending she can find another solution.
Narrator: There is only one day left before she intends to leave Shateroo.
Narrator: She spends the morning saying goodbye without admitting that she is doing so.
